Difficulty:Medium
Description:It is your first main phase. You control Hellkite Charger (5/5 flying haste; whenever it attacks, you may pay {5}{R}{R} to untap all attacking creatures and get an additional combat phase) and seven untapped Mountains. The opponent is at 10 life and controls no creatures. Reduce the opponent to 0 life this turn.
Rule:authored-additional-combat-phase | An additional combat phase has its own declare attackers step, and untapped creatures may attack again (CR 500.8, 506.1): pay the seven Mountains when the Charger attacks, deal 5, then attack again for 5; the Mountains' mana can be produced when the trigger resolves, since lands keep their mana until tapped (CR 106.4)
